[{:db/id "q-141159/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "90651eaf-c146-532f-9cb5-80f591989c27" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141159/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "37b67e26-88ae-54bc-ab2e-d4e87f9c340b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141159/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "4982bee4-e258-5bee-ac44-60ecfa556299" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141159/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "a1ee4366-02d0-5ffc-ad7e-97da5bd8acbf" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141159/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "f0a725b9-f580-5784-b0b9-e149e4e72fb0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141159/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a589bdb3-81ae-5bb4-9120-de1332971711" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-141159/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer-field/choices ["q-141159/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" "q-141159/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" "q-141159/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" "q-141159/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" "q-141159/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-141159" :question/id #uuid "6920e043-98c8-591f-ba7e-c0a9f1bbfc02" :question/math-academy-id "q-141159" :question/problem "Consider the standard Hermitian inner product $⟨\\,\\cdot \\,,\\,\\cdot \\,⟩$ over $C.$ \nWhich of the following statements are true? \n\n- $⟨a,b⟩=⟨b,a⟩$ for any $a,b\\in {C}^{n}$\n- $⟨a,\\alpha b⟩=\\alpha ⟨a,b⟩$ for any $a,b\\in {C}^{n}$ and any $\\alpha \\in R$\n- $⟨a,a⟩>0$ for any $a\\in {C}^{n}$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the standard Hermitian inner product over $C$ satisfies the following properties:\n\n- It is linear in the first argument. For any $a,b,c\\in {C}^{n}$ and any $\\alpha \\in C,$ we have\n\n$\\,$ $⟨a+b,c⟩=⟨a,c⟩+⟨b,c⟩\\,$ and $\\,⟨\\alpha a,b⟩=\\alpha ⟨a,b⟩.$\n\n- It is antilinear in the second argument. For any $a,b,c\\in {C}^{n}$ and any $\\alpha \\in C,$ we have\n\n$\\,$ $⟨a,b+c⟩=⟨a,b⟩+⟨a,c⟩\\,$ and $\\,⟨a,\\alpha b⟩=\\overset{―}{\\alpha }⟨a,b⟩.$\n\n- It has conjugate symmetry. For any $a,b\\in {C}^{n},$ we have\n\n$\\,$ $⟨a,b⟩=\\overset{―}{⟨b,a⟩}.$\n\n- It is positive-definite. For any $a\\in {C}^{n},$ we have\n\n$\\,$ $⟨a,a⟩$ is a non-negative real number, and $⟨a,a⟩=0$ if and only if $a=0.$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our statements.\n\n- Statement I is false. The inner product over $C$ has conjugate symmetry.\n\n- Statement II is true. For any $\\alpha \\in R,$ we have $\\overset{―}{\\alpha }=\\alpha .$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n⟨a,\\alpha b⟩=\\overset{―}{\\alpha }⟨a,b⟩=\\alpha ⟨a,b⟩.\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false. Notice that if $a=0,$ then $⟨a,a⟩=0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-141159/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "42258cf7-c1cf-5cc3-876d-102cc2233083"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-141159"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
